"to": 290,
"text": "Local gates /implement runs. The harness lifecycle leg runs against processes the entries themselves start and stop. No external process is driven and no live leg exists this chunk, so there is no `probe` precondition. The session id `gate-smoke` is pre-cleaned by the first lifecycle entry (cleanup is idempotent), so a re-run never collides with a prior run's residue. The mutation entries run the whole chunk diff (base = this chunk's take-up HEAD `13b7ee3`). The long one runs in the background. The last two entries witness CI on the operator's push."
}
